rule TemperatureLimit
	statement: A machine whose temperature exceeds its TempMaxC limit is overheating; an overheating injection molder also produces more rejected units.
	lineageTag: 849a180f-6259-4eae-a481-a7004665fbdc

	ruleReferencedEntity Machine
		propertyScope: specific

		ruleReferencedProperty TemperatureC

		ruleReferencedProperty TempMaxC

		ruleReferencedProperty UnitsRejected
